@startuml View Product Category Detail Sequence Diagram
title UC10 - View Product Category Detail (Xem chi tiết danh mục sản phẩm)

actor "Staff/Manager" as User
participant "Product\nCategories Page" as Frontend
participant "productRoutes" as Routes
participant "authMiddleware" as AuthMW
participant "productController" as Controller
participant "productService" as Service
participant "ProductCategory\nModel" as Model
database "MongoDB" as DB

== User đang xem danh sách ==
User -> Frontend: 1. Click "Xem chi tiết"\ntrên một category
activate Frontend

Frontend -> Frontend: 2. handleViewDetail(record)\nđược gọi

== Lấy chi tiết product category ==
Frontend -> Routes: 3. GET /api/product-categories/:id\n(Bearer Token)
activate Routes

Routes -> AuthMW: 4. Verify JWT token
activate AuthMW

AuthMW -> Routes: 5. req.user = decoded
deactivate AuthMW

Routes -> Controller: 6. getProductCategoryById\n(req, res)
activate Controller

Controller -> Controller: 7. Extract:\n- categoryId từ req.params.id\n- canteenId từ req.user

Controller -> Service: 8. getProductCategoryById\n(categoryId, canteenId)
activate Service

Service -> Service: 9. Build filter:\n{\n  _id: categoryId,\n  canteenId: canteenId\n}

Service -> Model: 10. findOne(filter)
activate Model

Model -> DB: 11. Query:\ndb.productcategories.findOne({\n  _id: ObjectId(categoryId),\n  canteenId: ObjectId(canteenId)\n})
activate DB

opt Category không tồn tại hoặc không thuộc canteen
    DB --> Model: 12a. Return null
    deactivate DB
    
    Model --> Service: null
    deactivate Model
    
    Service -> Service: throw AppError(\n"Product category not found",\n404)
    
    Service --> Controller: Error: 404 Not Found
    deactivate Service
    
    Controller --> Routes: HTTP 404 Response:\n{\n  success: false,\n  message: "Not found"\n}
    deactivate Controller
    
    Routes --> Frontend: JSON Error Response
    deactivate Routes
    
    Frontend -> Frontend: Show error message
    
    Frontend --> User: Hiển thị:\n"Không tìm thấy danh mục"
end

DB --> Model: 12. Return category document:\n{\n  _id: "xxx",\n  name: "Cơm",\n  description: "Các món cơm",\n  canteenId: "yyy",\n  isActive: true,\n  createdAt: "...",\n  updatedAt: "..."\n}
    deactivate DB
    
    Model --> Service: 13. Return category object
    deactivate Model
    
    Service --> Controller: 14. Return category
    deactivate Service
    
    Controller -> Controller: 15. Format response:\n{\n  success: true,\n  message: "Lấy chi tiết\n  danh mục sản phẩm thành công",\n  data: category\n}
    
    Controller --> Routes: 16. HTTP 200 Response
    deactivate Controller
    
    Routes --> Frontend: 17. JSON Response
    deactivate Routes
    
    Frontend -> Frontend: 18. setState:\n- selected = response.data\n- detailOpen = true
    
    Frontend -> Frontend: 19. Render Modal\nvới thông tin:\n- Tên danh mục\n- Mô tả\n- Trạng thái\n- Ngày tạo\n- Cập nhật lần cuối
    
    Frontend --> User: 20. Hiển thị Modal\nvới chi tiết category\n+ Nút "Chỉnh sửa"

deactivate Frontend

== User có thể chỉnh sửa từ modal ==
User -> Frontend: 21. Click nút\n"Chỉnh sửa" trong modal
activate Frontend

Frontend -> Frontend: 22. Close detail modal\nOpen edit form\nvới dữ liệu selected

Frontend --> User: 23. Hiển thị form chỉnh sửa
deactivate Frontend

@enduml
